<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    All user-facing text lives here rather than in the Compose code.

    Multi-language support is a POE requirement (Requirement 7): English plus at least two official
    South African languages. isiZulu is in values-zu/ and Afrikaans in values-af/.

    Text that comes from the API is not here. Medication names, dependant names and the server's
    own messages are data, and translating them on the device would mean guessing at something the
    server already decides — the API localises its notification text from the same stored
    preference that selects these resources.
-->
